{
  "speakers": {
    "npc": {
      "name": {
        "type": "expression",
        "expression": "q.npc.name"
      },
      "face": "q.npc.face();"
    }
  },
  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "line_0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [],
      "input": {
        "type": "auto-continue",
        "delay": 0.01,
        "allowSkip": false,
        "action": [
          "t.next_page = q.run_script('ccs:battle__landing');",
          "q.dialogue.set_page(t.next_page);"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "line_1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Fwahahaha! A mere child like you dares to challenge me?"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('line_2');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line_2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Very well, I shall show you true terror as a ninja master!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('battle');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "battle",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "You shall feel the despair of poison and sleep techniques!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "v.min_level='65';",
        "v.advancement='ccs:kanto/fuchsia/koga';",
        "q.player.set_npc_variable(q.npc, 'advancement', v.advancement);",
        "q.player.set_npc_variable(q.npc, 'trainer_id', 'leader_koga');",
        "q.dialogue.close();",
        "!q.is_blank(v.min_level) ? q.player.set_npc_variable(q.npc, 'min_level', v.min_level);",
        "!q.is_blank(v.advancement) ? q.run_command('/execute at @e[type=marker,tag=leader_koga,limit=1,sort=nearest] run tp ' + q.player.username() + ' ~ ~ ~ facing entity ' + q.npc.uuid() );",
        "q.npc.start_battle(q.player, 'single');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "win",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Humph! You have proven your worth! Here! Take the Soul Badge!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "v.reward_type='tm';",
        "v.reward='toxic';",
        "t.next_page = q.run_script('ccs:battle__landing_win');",
        "q.dialogue.set_page(t.next_page)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reward_give",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Ah! Take this too!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.run_script('ccs:give_reward');",
        "q.dialogue.set_page('reward_gave');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reward_gave",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Sealed within that TM06 lies Toxic! It is a secret technique dating back some four hundred years."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.close();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "won",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "When afflicted by Toxic, Pok\u00e9mon suffer more and more as battle progresses! It will surely terrorize foes!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.close();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bye",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [],
      "input": {
        "type": "auto-continue",
        "delay": 0.01,
